# Rootweave Caves' Root Warrens (CIPlay rootweave_caves_caves, 11-08; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
# The dug system in the north-east hill: in by mouth C (hill flank over the den path) down to the root hall, down the
# ramp to the lower level, out by mouth A (the shelf under the Bee Hall's cliff); back in by A, up the ramp, out by C.
# The thorn drift walked along its planks to the survey kit at its end and back. Run under CIGapsWatchHealth: no walk
# here may cost health.
island Rootweave Caves keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
where Loot_ChestSmall
where Zone_Trigger
where Block_Floor_Wood
where Note_Sign
where Creature_Rat

# Mouth C: in, down to the hall
picture rw_c_out 8.2 +1.7 44 9.3 15 38
walk 8.5 42 to 9 39.5 to 10 33 to 11 29 to 14.5 27.5
picture rw_hall 11 14.5 29.5 15 13 27
# down the ramp to the lower level, out by mouth A
walk 14.5 27.5 below=16 to 17 24.5 to 22 23.5
picture rw_ramp 22 11.5 23.5 15 13.5 27.3
walk 22 23.5 below=14 to 31 20.5 to 39 18.5 to 42 18.5
picture rw_a_out 44.5 +1.7 18.2 38 11 18.6
picture rw_a_in 33 11.5 20.2 22 10.5 23.5

# back in by A, up the ramp, out by C
walk 42 18.5 to 39 18.5 to 31 20.5 to 22 23.5 to 17 24.5 to 14.5 27.5 to 11 29 to 10 33 to 9 39.5 to 8.5 42

# The thorn drift: the sign, the planks along the wall, the survey kit
walk 8.5 42 to 9 39.5 to 10 33 to 11 29 to 11 27.5
picture rw_drift_sign 12.2 14.5 28.5 9.3 13.5 25.8
picture rw_drift 11 14.5 25.5 9 13 18
walk 11 27.5 below=16 to 10.9 24 to 10.77 22.6 to 10.63 21.1 to 10.5 19.6 to 10.36 18.1 to 9.6 17.4
open Survey kit
wait 3
expect item Rope 2
walk 9.6 17.4 below=16 to 10.36 18.1 to 10.5 19.6 to 10.63 21.1 to 10.77 22.6 to 10.9 24 to 11 27.5
walk 11 27.5 below=16 to 11 29 to 10 33 to 9 39.5 to 8.5 42
